y-font"},{"id":"e4fef91a7d9c57863","kind":"glyph","char":"7","font":"CMBX12","bbox":[72,306.56,80.07,320.91],"pathHash":"","ordinal":0,"label":"formula","confidence":0.96,"rule":"math-font","unitId":"uc35c107f4c7d","unitType":"inline","equationNumber":false},{"id":"ecaa38d5d2dfead01","kind":"glyph","char":"Discussion","font":"CMBX12","bbox":[96.21,306.56,169.82,320.91],"pathHash":"","ordinal":0,"label":"formula","confidence":0.96,"rule":"math-font","unitId":"uc35c107f4c7d","unitType":"inline","equationNumber":false},{"id":"ec7f623fcd55e4d73","kind":"glyph","char":"MR image reconstruction is an inverse problem, and thus it has many connections to inverse","font":"CMR10","bbox":[72,334.35,540,345.26],"pathHash":"","ordinal":0,"label":"text","confidence":0.93,"rule":"body-font"},{"id":"ecf6db059b9c43ee4","kind":"glyph","char":"problems in the computer vision literature [40, 7, 4, 47], such as super-resolution, denoising and","font":"CMR10","bbox":[72,347.9,540,358.81],"pathHash":"","ordinal":0,"label":"text","confidence":0.93,"rule":"body-font"},{"id":"ee5d745825a4700aa","kind":"glyph","char":"in-painting. In all of these inverse problems, the goal is to recover a high-dimensional ground truth","font":"CMR10","bbox":[72,361.45,540,372.36],"pathHash":"","ordinal":0,"label":"text","confidence":0.93,"rule":"body-font"},{"id":"e8dc001ccc04057b4","kind":"glyph","char":"image from a lower-dimensional measurement. Such ill-posed problems are very difficult to solve","font":"CMR10","bbox":[72,375,540,385.91],"pathHash":"","ordinal":0,"label":"text","confidence":0.93,"rule":"body-font"},{"id":"e780e71f096735ce5","kind":"glyph","char":"since there exists an infinite number of high-dimensional images that can result in the same-low","font":"CMR10","bbox":[72,388.55,540,399.46],"pathHash":"","ordinal":0,"label":"text","confidence":0.93,"rule":"body-font"},{"id":"e50cef814e212e323","kind":"glyph","char":"dimensional measurement. In order to simplify the problem, an assumption is often made that only","font":"CMR10","bbox":[72,402.1,540,413],"pathHash":"","ordinal":0,"label":"text","confidence":0.93,"rule":"body-font"},{"id":"e839695b52897f4d8","kind":"glyph","char":"a small number of high-resolution images would correspond to natural images [4]. Given that MRI","font":"CMR10","bbox":[72,415.64,539.99,426.55],"pathHash":"","ordinal":0,"label":"text","confidence":0.93,"rule":"body-font"},{"id":"ef7cf35d5e33252c4","kind":"glyph","char":"reconstruction is a similar inverse problem, we hope that the computer vision community, as well","font":"CMR10","bbox":[72,429.19,540,440.1],"pathHash":"","ordinal":0,"label":"text","confidence":0.93,"rule":"body-font"},{"id":"e372bdaaf9699263d","kind":"glyph","char":"as the medical imaging community, will find our dataset beneficial.","font":"CMR10","bbox":[72,442.74,391.85,453.65],"pathHash":"","ordinal":0,"label":"text","confidence":0.93,"rule":"body-font"},{"id":"e7deb29b3701cb86d","kind":"glyph","char":"In the clinical setting, radiologists use MRI to search for abnormalities, make diagnoses, and","font":"CMR10","bbox":[88.94,456.29,540,467.2],"pathHash":"","ordinal":0,"label":"text","confidence":0.93,"rule":"body-font"},{"id":"e938227861564ffdf","kind":"glyph","char":"recommend treatment options.","font":"CMR10","bbox":[72,469.84,220.94,480.75],"pathHash":"","ordinal":0,"label":"text","confidence":0.93,"rule":"body-font"},{"id":"e4ec14a72a4d396d3","kind":"glyph","char":"Thus, contrary to many computer vision problems where small","font":"CMR10","bbox":[229.47,469.84,540,480.75],"pathHash":"","ordinal":0,"label":"text","confidence":0.93,"rule":"body-font"},{"id":"e2275a550ab3a4ddd","kind":"glyph","char":"texture changes might not necessarily alter the overall satisfaction of the observer, in MRI recon-","font":"CMR10","bbox":[72,483.39,540,494.3],"pathHash":"","ordinal":0,"label":"text","confidence":0.93,"rule":"body-font"},{"id":"e46214c3041c4aa34","kind":"glyph","char":"struction, extra care should be taken to ensure that the human interpreter is not misled by a very","font":"CMR10","bbox":[72,496.94,540,507.85],"pathHash":"","ordinal":0,"label":"text","confidence":0.93,"rule":"body-font"},{"id":"ed6a8b75b2bd87f3a","kind":"glyph","char":"plausible but not necessarily correct reconstruction. This is especially important as image gener-","font":"CMR10","bbox":[72,510.49,540,521.4],"pathHash":"","ordinal":0,"label":"text","confidence":0.93,"rule":"body-font"},{"id":"e7d16d631245363f0","kind":"glyph","char":"ation techniques increase in their ability to generate photo-realistic results [49].","font":"CMR10","bbox":[72,524.04,458.76,534.95],"pathHash":"","ordinal":0,"label":"text","confidence":0.93,"rule":"body-font"},{"id":"e4cc138059b314bc2","kind":"glyph","char":"Therefore some","font":"CMR10","bbox":[466.04,524.04,540,534.95],"pathHash":"","ordinal":0,"label":"text","confidence":0.93,"rule":"body-font"},{"id":"e0d7bfcee27fcb2e3","kind":"glyph","char":"research effort should be devoted to look for solutions that, by design, ensure correct diagnosis, and","font":"CMR10","bbox":[72,537.59,540,548.5],"pathHash":"","ordinal":0,"label":"text","confidence":0.93,"rule":"body-font"},{"id":"e76cf753ac7e706c1","kind":"glyph","char":"we hope that our dataset will provide a testbed for new ideas in these directions as well.","font":"CMR10","bbox":[72,551.14,494.6,562.05],"pathHash":"","ordinal":0,"label":"text","confidence":0.93,"rule":"body-font"},{"id":"eefa506d8f3b88f32","kind":"glyph","char":"An important question in MRI reconstruction is the choice of the evaluation metric.","font":"CMR10","bbox":[88.94,564.69,511.27,575.59],"pathHash":"","ordinal":0,"label":"text","confidence":0.93,"rule":"body-font"},{"id":"ee603d2024201f214","kind":"glyph","char":"The","font":"CMR10","bbox":[521.21,564.69,540,575.59],"pathHash":"","ordinal":0,"label":"text","confidence":0.93,"rule":"body-font"},{"id":"ecc9c3e6537d79d5e","kind":"glyph","char":"current consensus in the MRI community is that global metrics, such as NMSE, SSIM and PSNR,","font":"CMR10","bbox":[72,578.23,540,589.14],"pathHash":"","ordinal":0,"label":"text","confidence":0.93,"rule":"body-font"},{"id":"ed4367ba7d46eb339","kind":"glyph","char":"do not necessarily capture the level of detail required for proper evaluation of MRI reconstruction","font":"CMR10","bbox":[72,591.78,540,602.69],"pathHash":"","ordinal":0,"label":"text","confidence":0.93,"rule":"body-font"},{"id":"ef190d3e28ec24290","kind":"glyph","char":"algorithms [25, 16]. A natural question arises: what would the optimal metric be? An ideal MRI","font":"CMR10","bbox":[72,605.33,540,616.24],"pathHash":"","ordinal":0,"label":"text","confidence":0.93,"rule":"body-font"},{"id":"e2752d89e7b380985","kind":"glyph","char":"reconstruction algorithm should produce sharp, trustworthy images, that ultimately ensure the","font":"CMR10","bbox":[72,618.88,540,629.79],"pathHash":"","ordinal":0,"label":"text","confidence":0.93,"rule":"body-font"},{"id":"e4feb394b04a4e292","kind":"glyph","char":"proper radiologic interpretation. While our dataset will help ensure consistent evaluation, we hope","font":"CMR10","bbox":[72,632.43,539.99,643.34],"pathHash":"","ordinal":0,"label":"text","confidence":0.93,"rule":"body-font"},{"id":"e5b57ac799642a721","kind":"glyph","char":"that it will also trigger research on MRI reconstruction metrics.","font":"CMR10","bbox":[72,645.98,383.09,656.89],"pathHash":"","ordinal":0,"label":"text","confidence":0.93,"rule":"body-font"},{"id":"eff9350d8773474d6","kind":"glyph","char":"This goal will be impossible to","font":"CMR10","bbox":[390.13,645.98,540,656.89],"pathHash":"","ordinal":0,"label":"text","confidence":0.93,"rule":"body-font"},{"id":"ede740901d70b4fee","kind":"glyph","char":"achieve without clinical studies involving radiologists evaluating fully-sampled and undersampled","font":"CMR10","bbox":[72,659.53,540,670.44],"pathHash":"","ordinal":0,"label":"text","confidence":0.93,"rule":"body-font"},{"id":"e4590d15469dfd326","kind":"glyph","char":"MRI reconstructions to make sure that both images lead to the same diagnosis.","font":"CMR10","bbox":[72,673.08,452.36,683.99],"pathHash":"","ordinal":0,"label":"text","confidence":0.93,"rule":"body-font"},{"id":"ef0781d8ec8b23c7b","kind":"glyph","char":"Although this dataset provides an excellent entry point for machine learning methods for MR","font":"CMR10","bbox":[88.94,686.63,540,697.54],"pathHash":"","ordinal":0,"label":"text","confidence":0.93,"rule":"body-font"},{"id":"e190b8e15bdadd718","kind":"glyph","char":"reconstruction, there are some aspects of MR imaging that we have not yet considered here. Phys-","font":"CMR10","bbox":[72,700.18,540,711.09],"pathHash":"","ordinal":0,"label":"text","confidence":0.93,"rule":"body-font"},{"id":"e161ea1576f92e302","kind":"glyph","char":"21","font":"CMR10","bbox":[300.54,738.98,311.45,749.89],"pathHash":"","ordinal":0,"label":"text","confidence":0.93,"rule":"body-font"},{"id":"ef08204a2ca973ff7","kind":"image","char":"","font":"","bbox":[74,71,305,240],"pathHash":"","ordinal":0,"label":"other","confidence":0.9,"rule":"image","source":"image"},{"id":"e45d81ce8535ce7b7","kind":"image","char":"","font":"","bbox":[307,71,538,240],"pathHash":"","ordinal":0,"label":"other","confidence":0.9,"rule":"image","source":"image"}],"units":[{"id":"uc35c107f4c7d","type":"inline","equationNumber":false,"confidence":0.96,"fallback":false,"elementIds":["e4fef91a7d9c57863","ecaa38d5d2dfead01"]}]}